    <bpmn:process id="W_W1801" name="W1801. Vendor-Funded Digital Marketing &amp; Social Media Campaign" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Digital marketing campaign planning cycle
Frequency: ~10–20 vendor-funded digital campaigns/year
Volume: ~PHP 10–20M in annual vendor-funded digital marketing
Owner: CMO
Participants: CMO, Digital Marketing Team, Vendor, Agency
Source: workflow W1801 — Vendor-Funded Digital Marketing &amp; Social Media Campaign</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1801_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1801_Lane1" name="Digital Marketing Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1801_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1801_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1801_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1801_Lane2" name="Vendor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1801_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1801_Lane3" name="Marketing Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1801_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1801_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1801_Start5" name="Digital marketing campaign planning cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1801_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1801_Task6" name="Digital Marketing Team proposes vendor-funded digital campaign: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Digital Marketing Team proposes vendor-funded digital campaign: (a) Facebook/Instagram sponsored posts featuring vendor products, (b) Google Shopping ads for vendor category, (c) YouTube how-to videos featuring vendor tools/products, (d) influencer partnerships (local DIY/construction content creators), (e) marketplace (Shopee/Lazada) featured listings, (f) each proposal includes: expected reach, engagement rate, cost, and vendor contribution request
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Team
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1801_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1801_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1801_Task7" name="Vendor approves digital campaign budget and creative: (a) vendor provides brand…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vendor approves digital campaign budget and creative: (a) vendor provides brand guidelines, (b) approves ad copy and visuals, (c) commits funding amount, (d) BuildRight executes campaign and tracks performance
Responsible (R): Vendor / CMO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1801_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1801_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1801_Task8" name="Campaign execution: (a) ads launched per schedule, (b) real-time performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Campaign execution: (a) ads launched per schedule, (b) real-time performance tracking (impressions, clicks, conversions, ROAS), (c) mid-campaign optimization (adjust targeting, creative, budget allocation), (d) post-campaign report shared with vendor
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Team
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Campaign duration</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1801_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1801_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1801_Task9" name="Co-op claim: digital campaign costs documented (ad platform invoices, agency…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Co-op claim: digital campaign costs documented (ad platform invoices, agency fees, influencer fees); POP submitted to vendor per W1799
Responsible (R): Marketing Team / AP Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Post-campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1801_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1801_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1801_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1801_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1801_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-359 (ensure controlled execution — Co-Op Marketing &amp; Promotional Fund Management (PA-39.2).) | - operational: CMO review and approval gate
Owner: CMO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
